The '''Inactive Aku Altar''' is an [[Enemy Bases|Enemy Base]]. It was added in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Inactive Aku Altar
|image = E 575.png
|appearance = All stages that had the [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]]
|money drop = N/A
}}

==Enemy==
As the name suggests, it does nothing despite its special treatment as an animated base, basically acting as a regular base that can be hurt by [[Surge Attack]]s and [[Explosion]]s. Appears in place of the [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]] once it gets deactivated by completing the [[Mount Aku (Aku Realm)/Invasion|Mount Aku/Mount Fuji Invasion]].

